{"id":"8abc268dbc50df5d","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-compmeasure.md","title":"Cantor 空间上的可计算概率测度","display":"df-compmeasure — Cantor 空间上的可计算概率测度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-compmeasure","aliases":["43-df-compmeasure"],"display":"df-compmeasure — Cantor 空间上的可计算概率测度","depends_on":["[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.9.1 Definition 9.9.1，印刷198，PDF218","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-compmeasure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-compmeasure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compmeasure — Cantor 空间上的可计算概率测度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.9.1 Definition 9.9.1，印刷198，PDF218"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 的Borel概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma]\">\\([\\sigma]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。有理数及有限串采用固定可计算编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>；下式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\">\\(q:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 已由函数类型要求在整个有效编码域上总定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableMeasure}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableMeasure}\\)</span> 是Cantor空间Borel概率测度上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\exists q:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(\\sigma,k)-\\nu([\\sigma])|\\le2^{-k}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\exists q:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(\\sigma,k)-\\nu([\\sigma])|\\le2^{-k}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>必须统一计算柱集测度的Cauchy近似，不能把实值函数直接塞入自然数部分可计算谓词。当前Computable采用固定有限串和有理数编码；q的总性由量化函数类型显式给定，避免把仅对自然数全域定义的TotalComputable无下标缩写误用于代码域。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.9.1 Definition 9.9.1，印刷198，PDF218。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 的Borel概率测度，$[\\sigma]$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。有理数及有限串采用固定可计算编码，$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]；下式中的 $q:2^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q$ 已由函数类型要求在整个有效编码域上总定义。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 的Borel概率测度，$[\\sigma]$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。有理数及有限串采用固定可计算编码，$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]；下式中的 $q:2^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q$ 已由函数类型要求在整个有效编码域上总定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"q:2^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableMeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)\\iff\\exists q:2^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(\\sigma,k)-\\nu([\\sigma])|\\le2^{-k}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1725,"backlinks":[{"id":"35c96ed38b162487","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是满足 $\\mathrm{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)$ 的Borel概率测度（see [[43-df-compmeasure]]），$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}$ 见 [[43-df-effective-open]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-compmeasure]] — Cantor 空间上的可计算概率测度"},{"id":"0e7016d5e6e71f46","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是满足 $\\operatorname{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)$ 的Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$。可计算测度、原子、柱集及 $\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)$ 见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]、[[43-df-computable]]；$X$ 视为自然数域上的总二值函数。"},{"id":"38b337ed607def8b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是可计算Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$ 且 $\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)$；相关定义见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]、[[43-df-mltestnu]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。"},{"id":"620117fc884bad92","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 为可计算Borel概率测度且 $\\operatorname{ContinuousMeasure}(\\nu)$，$A\\in2^\\omega$。$\\equiv_T$ 按二进制序列与特征集合识别解释；相关定义见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"7f929e689547cc3b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["8e999d59227f4a28","ab1ef7b1cac112c1","f357216a7edb035a"]}